# [The Cipher Relay](cipher_relic_doc)

The third piece, and the one that was HIDDEN rather than merely left.

**All chambers and passages - a maze, not a building.** The relay was buried in a nebula
and then buried again inside itself: five bubbles connected by corridors, with two of the
five connected only by a route nobody would guess from outside. The Ash Warren's chart is
the difference between finding the Cipher and flying around a rock for an hour.

Every other ruin in this campaign opens out from its mouth. This one folds back on itself.

