## [Items](items)

### [the Cipher](beacon_cipher)
---
Type: item/quest
Art: unknown
Tier: 5
---
The keying array: the piece that makes the Beacon's line mean something rather than merely
carry. Without it the Voice and the Lens shout a clear, precise, meaningless note.

